   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL05C:18e",
   "ptr": "0x18e",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "「おぼろげながら・・・まるで、他人の\\n",
   "en": "\"Dimly... As if I'd been tossed into another's dream, writhing in agony...",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "マルダー\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL05C:1b7",
   "ptr": "0x1b7",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　夢に放り込まれもがき苦しんでたよう\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 07CSL05C:18e"
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL05C:1e0",
   "ptr": "0x1e0",
   "len": 24,
   "jp": "　な感じでしたが・・・\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 24,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 07CSL05C:18e"
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL05C:1fc",
   "ptr": "0x1fc",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　確かに、あの時は色々と、兵を動かし\\n",
   "en": "Ah, yes, I did move the troops about quite a bit back then.\"",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL05C:225",
   "ptr": "0x225",
   "len": 18,
   "jp": "　てましたなァ」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 18,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
