  {
   "id": "07CSL05C:31a",
   "ptr": "0x31a",
   "len": 16,
   "jp": "「・・・ふむ？\\n",
   "en": "\"...Hmm? It seems my manner of speaking displeases you. ......",
   "max": 16,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "マルダー\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL05C:32d",
   "ptr": "0x32d",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　どうやら、私の物言いが、お気に召さ\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 07CSL05C:31a"
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL05C:356",
   "ptr": "0x356",
   "len": 30,
   "jp": "　ないらしい。　・・・・・・\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 30,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 07CSL05C:31a"
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL05C:378",
   "ptr": "0x378",
   "len": 32,
   "jp": "　では、はっきり言いましょう。\\n",
   "en": "Let me be plain. The Black Dragon, the ruins... none of it matters to me. They're merely a nuisance.",
   "max": 32,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL05C:39b",
   "ptr": "0x39b",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　私にとって、黒竜だの遺跡だのは、ど\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 07CSL05C:378"
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL05C:3c4",
   "ptr": "0x3c4",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　うでもいいんです。むしろ、やっかい\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 07CSL05C:378"
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL05C:3ed",
   "ptr": "0x3ed",
   "len": 16,
   "jp": "　なだけでね。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 16,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 07CSL05C:378"
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL05C:401",
   "ptr": "0x401",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　貴族たちの国クライツェン・・・この\\n",
   "en": "Kreutzen, the nation of nobles... I wish to preserve this order. In other words, I want everything to stay just as it has always been. That is my wish.",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL05C:42a",
   "ptr": "0x42a",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　体制を維持すること。すなわち、全て\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 07CSL05C:401"
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL05C:453",
   "ptr": "0x453",
   "len": 32,
   "jp": "　が今まで通りであってほしい。\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 32,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 07CSL05C:401"
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL05C:476",
   "ptr": "0x476",
   "len": 20,
   "jp": "　それが望みです。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 20,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 07CSL05C:401"
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL05C:48e",
   "ptr": "0x48e",
   "len": 40,
   "jp": "　今回は少なからぬ犠牲者が出ましたが。\\n",
   "en": "This time, no small number of lives were lost. Well then, one need only remove the cause.",
   "max": 40,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL05C:4b9",
   "ptr": "0x4b9",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　ならば、その元凶を取り除けばいいだ\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 07CSL05C:48e"
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL05C:4e2",
   "ptr": "0x4e2",
   "len": 14,
   "jp": "　けのこと。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 14,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 07CSL05C:48e"
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL05C:4f4",
   "ptr": "0x4f4",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　そのために、兵や市民がいくら死んで\\n",
   "en": "And to that end, it matters not how many soldiers or citizens die...... So long as the nobles are secure, that is enough.",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL05C:51d",
   "ptr": "0x51d",
   "len": 30,
   "jp": "　もかまいません・・・・・・\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 30,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 07CSL05C:4f4"
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL05C:53e",
   "ptr": "0x53e",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　貴族たちが安泰ならば、それでいいの\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "　もかまいません・・・・・・\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 07CSL05C:4f4"
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL05C:567",
   "ptr": "0x567",
   "len": 10,
   "jp": "　です。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 10,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 07CSL05C:4f4"
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL05C:575",
   "ptr": "0x575",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　なぜなら、栄えある聖堂騎士団の子孫\\n",
   "en": "For Kreutzen exists only because of us nobles, the descendants of the glorious Templar Knights, you see.",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL05C:59e",
   "ptr": "0x59e",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　たる、我ら貴族たちがあってこその、\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 07CSL05C:575"
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL05C:5c7",
   "ptr": "0x5c7",
   "len": 32,
   "jp": "　クライツェンなのですからね。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 32,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 07CSL05C:575"
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL05C:5eb",
   "ptr": "0x5eb",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　さて！　私は執務を続けねばなりませ\\n",
   "en": "Now! I must return to my duties. Forgive me, but our little talk ends here.\"",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
